# Component lab (`/dev`)

`src/app/dev` is the visual inventory. It is not the product site. Entry is a manual URL (`/dev/ui`, `/dev/templates`, `/dev/icons`). The lab shell (header and gallery pages) uses `Container width="full"` so it spans the viewport; do not wrap it in `xl`.

In the **same turn** as any change to UI, Templates, Icons, theme tokens (`src/settings`, `globals.css`), or component config, update the matching gallery so permutations stay complete:

- UI / tokens / Button–Dropdown–Container config → `src/app/dev/ui`
- Templates → `src/app/dev/templates`
- Icons / registry → `src/app/dev/icons`

Do not finish a component or token change while `/dev` is stale. Do not put lab chrome in `SiteHeader` or dictionaries.
